ary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 15th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Reinforced Saw</b>, available exclusively at <b><a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a></b>, commands a price tag of <span style=\"color:#1dab6f;\">$12,000</span> . Renowned as one of the best Saw in the game a player can purchase. \n</p><p>Saws are tools used to cut off the bark of trees, increasing their price. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Refined from the finest materials, the <b>Reinforced Saw</b> stands tall, crafted from <b>blacksteel (</b>a material yet to grace the realms of our game) and  <b><a href=\"/wiki/Adurite\" title=\"Adurite\">Adurite</a>.</b>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<p>- The <b>Reinforced Saw</b>, alongside its companions in the reinforced tool set, was introduced as part of the highly anticipated <b>Progression Update.</b>\n</p><p>- When introduced its original price was <span style=\"color:#1dab6f;\">$266,000</span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260830012514\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 77/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 67/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019482/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.329      1 Template:Saw\n100.00%   45.329      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in p